s vote  i we've had a consensus at every step of  the way  i expect we're gonna have a consensus on  this  good luck uh and uh you know i i always  appreciate you coming on  i know it may feel like a firing squad  at times but i  my job is to get answers it's a very  important issue and  uh i know it's it's fluid it's day to  day almost hour to hour of trying to get  this done  and i wish you luck i appreciate it then  thank you  that's uh larry scott commissioner of  the pac-12

